#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:2
msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:4
msgid ""
"Git Repository integrations allow integration of public or private Git "
"repositories in Github, GitLab or other services. Use your existing code and"
" any future code to build automation Tasks and Workflows, onboard Spec "
"Templates for Terraform and Kubernetes to build App configurations, and "
"more. Each time code from your repositories is invoked, |morpheus| will pull"
" the current live version (depending on configuration) so any recent changes"
" to the code are used."
msgstr ""
"Git Repository integrations allow integration of público o privado Git "
"repositories in Github, GitLab o otro servicios. Use your existente code y "
"cualquier future code to build automation Tasks y Workflows, onboard Spec "
"Templates para Terraform y Kubernetes to build App configurations, y más. "
"Each time code desde your repositories es invoked, |morpheus| será pull el "
"actual live versión (dependiendo de configuración) so cualquier recent "
"cambios to el code son used."

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:7
msgid "Creating an Integration"
msgstr "Crear integración"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:9
msgid ""
"New Git integrations are created either in the global integrations section "
"(|AdmInt|) or in the code integrations section (|ProCodInt|). You will need "
"an access code for authentication with private repositories, public "
"repositories can be integrated simply with a URL."
msgstr ""
"New Git integrations son creado either in el global integrations sección "
"(|AdmInt|) o in el code integrations sección (|ProCodInt|). You será need un"
" acceso code para authentication con privado repositories, público "
"repositories puede be integrated simply con un URL."

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:11
msgid ""
"Navigate to the global integrations section (|AdmInt|) or the code "
"integrations section (|ProCodInt|)"
msgstr ""
"Navegue un el global integrations sección (|AdmInt|) o el code integrations "
"sección (|ProCodInt|)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:12
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:13
msgid "Click Git repository"
msgstr "Click Git repository"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:14
msgid "Configure the following:"
msgstr "Configure el following:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:16
msgid ""
"**NAME:** A friendly name for the Git repository integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"**NAME:** A friendly nombre para el Git repository integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:17
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** When marked, code in this repository will be available for "
"creating automation or other |morpheus| constructs"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLED:** When marked, code in este repository estará disponible para "
"creating automation o otro |morpheus| constructs"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:18
msgid ""
"**DEFAULT BRANCH:** The default repository branch from which code should be "
"sourced"
msgstr ""
"**DEFAULT BRANCH:** The predeterminado repository branch desde cual code "
"debería be sourced"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:19
msgid ""
"**USERNAME:** For private repositories, enter an account name (such as a "
"Github username)"
msgstr ""
"**USERNAME:** For privado repositories, enter un cuenta nombre (como un "
"Github nombre de usuario)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:20
msgid ""
"**PASSWORD:** For Github and GitLab, password authentication is no longer "
"supported **but access tokens should go in this field.**"
msgstr ""
"**PASSWORD:** For Github y GitLab, contraseña authentication es no longer "
"compatible **pero acceso tokens debería go in este campo.**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:21
msgid ""
"**ACCESS TOKEN:** Currently an unused field, access tokens should go in the "
"Password field"
msgstr ""
"**ACCESS TOKEN:** Actualmente un unused campo, acceso tokens debería go in "
"el Password campo"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:22
msgid ""
"**KEY PAIR:**  (Optional) Select a stored SSH keypair for Github SSH "
"authentication"
msgstr ""
"**KEY PAIR:**  (Optional) Select un stored SSH keypair para Github SSH "
"authentication"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:23
msgid ""
"**ENABLE GIT REPOSITORY CACHING:** When unmarked, |morpheus| retrieves code "
"fresh from the repository each time it's invoked. When marked, |morpheus| "
"will use a cached version of the code if it's less than five minutes old. In"
" general, this should be left unmarked unless you are experiencing "
"performance issues related to very large amounts of code being invoked many "
"times during a deployment"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLE GIT REPOSITORY CACHING:** When unmarked, |morpheus| retrieves code "
"fresh desde el repository cada time it's invoked. When marked, |morpheus| "
"será use un cached versión of el code if it's less than five minutes old. In"
" general, este debería be left unmarked unless you son experiencing "
"performance issues relacionado con muy large amounts of code being invoked "
"muchos times durante un deployment"

#: ../../integration_guides/Deployments/Git.rst:25
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`"
